[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/feature/scare_events/scare_entry.gd" id="2"]

; Seeded from design/gdd/scare-events.md Detailed Design table (rules 2, 5-8). Enum values: see ScareEntry
; (Source 0 Monster/1 Survivor/2 RoundScript, Scope 0 Shared/1 SingleClient, Intensity 0 Major/1 Minor,
; Category 0 Player/1 Environment/2 Deception, Phase 0 Low/1 Rising/2 Emergency).
; Inference: every audible_range_m and presentation number (flash*, shake*) is a greybox placeholder, the GDD
; gives none; the recipient story (003) and the M4 horror pass settle them. Fuse-install alarm and recording
; have a Survivor entry and a RoundScript entry because an entry carries one source. False Signal: no entry (rule 4a).

